          "a636cf06-cd5c-459e-9081-6c25c9dedf1a": {
            "type": "text",
            "settings": {
              "title": "FULFIL A DREAM",
              "subtitle": "",
              "text": "<p>Whenever you purchase at Petit Nord, you get a little more than you buy. Together with us, you get the opportunity to help fulfil a dream. A dream that many couples share, but not all have the possibility to pursue.</p>",
              "center": true,
              "width_mx": 550,
              "font_size": 1,
              "section_background": "",
              "content_background": "",
              "content_text": "",
              "content_accent": "",
              "width": "default",
              "margin": 5,
              "section_padding": 0,
              "padding": 0
            }
          },
          "d5f594c8-a534-4cce-b162-f48d5fd99e60": {
            "type": "article_2",
            "settings": {
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/rsz_pn_aw21-224.jpg",
              "image_size": 0,
              "border_text": "",
              "title": "DONATION",
              "subtitle": "",
              "text": "<p>Petit Nord donates 100% of all sales from MBP accessories to individuals or couples struggling with infertility. When purchasing a pair of shoes, you can add one or more of our newly designed accessories. The price for 1 accessory is 40 DKK, 6 USD or 5 EUR. The full amount is donated to our cause.</p><p>2 times a year Petit Nord donates to one of the chosen non-profit charities:</p><p><a href=\"http://www.hopeforfertility.org/\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.hopeforfertility.org</a></p><p><a href=\"https://footstepsforfertility.org/\" target=\"_blank\">https://footstepsforfertility.org</a></p><p><a href=\"https://fertilityfoundation.org/\" target=\"_blank\">https://fertilityfoundation.org</a></p><p>This donation will help a financially restricted couple with difficulties conceiving come one step closer to their dream.</p>",
              "content_width": 450,
              "content_width_image": 450,
              "center": true,
              "fill_height": true,
              "mirror": false,
              "section_background": "",
              "content_background": "",
              "content_text": "#69554d",
              "content_accent": "#d99940",
              "width": "default",
              "margin": 5,
              "section_padding": 0,
              "padding": 0
            }
          },
          "41ab88c7-e715-4e96-b595-f911cf012778": {
            "type": "article_2",
            "settings": {
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/rsz_pn_aw21-240.jpg",
              "image_size": 0,
              "border_text": "",
              "title": "INFERTILITY",
              "subtitle": "",
              "text": "<p>Infertility is a rising problem, caused by a number of factors that we, as a company, do not have the power to change by ourselves. Still! With your engagement, there is a lot we can do.</p><p>Our ambition is to help couples. To create awareness. To inform how you can make a change for yourself. We wish to encourage social sharing in order to break the taboo related to infertility.</p>",
              "content_width": 450,
              "content_width_image": 550,
              "center": true,
              "fill_height": true,
              "mirror": true,
              "section_background": "",
              "content_background": "",
              "content_text": "",
              "content_accent": "",
              "width": "default",
              "margin": 5,
              "section_padding": 0,
              "padding": 0
            }
          },
          "0b1231ff-b39a-492c-91ab-8f645cfaeb4e": {
            "type": "article_2",
            "settings": {
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/ShearlingWinterBoots.jpg",
              "image_size": 0,
              "border_text": "",
              "title": "OUR MISSION",
              "subtitle": "",
              "text": "<p>By supporting Petit Nord, you can make a difference in this strenuous fight against infertility. For yourself and for others. Our mission is clear. More babies please.</p>",
              "content_width": 450,
              "content_width_image": 550,
              "center": true,
              "fill_height": true,
              "mirror": false,
              "section_background": "",
              "content_background": "",
              "content_text": "",
              "content_accent": "",
              "width": "default",
              "margin": 5,
              "section_padding": 0,
              "padding": 0
            }
          }
        },
