              "text1": "<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Age 1-2 years</strong></span></p><p>Discover consciously crafted walking shoes for your active child, with soft support, protection, and a flexible fit made for healthy strides. <a href=\"/pages/the-first-shoe\" title=\"The first Shoe\"><strong>See more</strong></a></p>",
