      "09f8d199-a5d5-4285-96bb-73a83f581535": {
        "type": "custom-homepage--featured_reviews",
        "blocks": {
          "review_YqWeHJ": {
            "type": "review",
            "settings": {
              "product": "",
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/qg3ecAcXls_mid.jpg",
              "heading": "<p>Classic Sandal Cheetah</p>",
              "text": "<p>We brought this brand new sandal with us to Thailand in 35 degrees celcius - I was suprised there was no blisters at all. Perfect fit and Hugo love the Leo print. </p>",
              "label": "<p>Emma A.</p><p><em>Verified Customer</em></p>"
            }
          },
          "review_XD3DUU": {
            "type": "review",
            "settings": {
              "product": "",
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/e9R4oH0rk_mid.jpg",
              "heading": "<p>Blueberry Classic Sandal Cream</p>",
              "text": "<p>I’ve been wanting this for a long time because the design is so adorable, and I finally got it! It’s very easy to wear, and my daughter absolutely loves it 🫐</p>",
              "label": "<p>Ayane N.</p><p><em>Verified Customer</em></p>"
            }
          },
          "review_M88iMg": {
            "type": "review",
            "settings": {
              "product": "",
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/5COR1Bnuq_mid.jpg",
              "heading": "<p>Butterfly Sandal</p>",
              "text": "<p>The butterfly detailing is just perfect, what a precious sandal!!! And that deep red colour, is literally the cherry on top. Beautiful and timeless!</p>",
              "label": "<p>Bri H.</p><p><em>Verified Customer</em></p>"
            }
          },
          "review_fXWCcd": {
            "type": "review",
            "settings": {
              "product": "",
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/yU3Ekkgsjb_mid.jpg",
              "heading": "<p>Classic Sandal Poppy</p>",
              "text": "<p>The pop of red just adds so much happiness to every outfit. Love how this model protects their toes while playing, beautiful and versatile!</p>",
              "label": "<p>Caroline W.</p><p><em>Verified Customer</em></p>"
            }
          },
          "review_cfkRVi": {
            "type": "review",
            "settings": {
              "product": "",
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/kOJqpNgCn_mid.jpg",
              "heading": "<p>Florence Sandal Cognac</p>",
              "text": "<p>These shoes are such a statement piece 🌸 I’ve already gotten so many compliments on them. I’m truly proud to wear them.</p>",
              "label": "<p>Estelle B.</p><p><em>Verified Customer</em></p>"
            }
          },
          "review_YRXyze": {
            "type": "review",
            "settings": {
              "product": "",
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/A7MO1h36zq_mid_837d6df4-d45f-416f-a2e7-02c2381ed4c9.jpg",
              "heading": "<p>Thea Ballerina </p>",
              "text": "<p>They are very light,comfortable,and cozy; I like their color and the way they are made. As a suggestion,I would also consider a larger last,maybe a size up for people with bigger feet. And perhaps a wider range of colors: light blue, silver, yellow...</p>",
              "label": "<p>Corina G.</p><p><em>Verified Customer</em></p>"
            }
          },
          "review_8f9TGU": {
            "type": "review",
            "settings": {
              "product": "",
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/lTAu4Vb41e_mid.jpg",
              "heading": "<p>Bow Sandal Cherry Patent</p>",
              "text": "<p>My daughter loves the sandals. She would love to wear them both at home and outside all the time. They have now become her favorite sandals, and she would like to wear them with all her outfits. They are truly beautiful. Great craftsmanship, a lovely color, really perfect for summer. We’re very happy.</p>",
              "label": "<p>Sophia B.</p><p><em>Verified Customer</em></p>"
            }
          },
          "review_x4GjdW": {
            "type": "review",
            "settings": {
              "product": "",
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/2lnA0fvma.jpg",
              "heading": "<p>Ladybug Low Sneaker</p>",
              "text": "<p>My son loves them! The cute ladybug details but also the fit is perfect for his shoes, his new faves for sure!</p>",
              "label": "<p>A.P.</p><p><em>Verified Customer</em></p>"
            }
          },
          "review_h8fE7G": {
            "type": "review",
            "settings": {
              "product": "",
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/sgPWmRy8s_mid.jpg",
              "heading": "<p>T-Bar Scallop</p>",
              "text": "<p>Completely in love with these T scallop shoes🫶🏻 They are everything!!! The details, the quality, comfort 100% amazing & colors to die for! You need them in your daughter's life!</p>",
              "label": "<p>Maven S.</p><p><em>Verified Customer</em></p>"
            }
          },
          "review_gqGjCP": {
            "type": "review",
            "settings": {
              "product": "",
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/4dZlwDlFk_mid.jpg",
              "heading": "<p>Chubby Cruiser Velcro</p>",
              "text": "<p>Adore! The softest shoes ever, first we had Sahara Suede and now we love Leopard🤎</p>",
              "label": "<p>Dajana K.</p><p><em>Verified Customer</em></p>"
            }
          },
          "review_BiK9gW": {
            "type": "review",
            "disabled": true,
            "settings": {
              "product": "",
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/VsVdxlVgf5_mid_1.jpg",
              "heading": "<p>Wild Strawberries Classic Sandal </p>",
              "text": "<p> Fantastic sandals in top quality! We are truly impressed with these sandals! They are made with a beautiful and sturdy quality that feels both durable and comfortable for the child to wear. The design is stylish and functional, and they fit well on the foot without causing any discomfort. Perfect for both play and everyday use– we can highly recommend them!</p>",
              "label": "<p>Camilla S.</p><p><em>Verified Customer</em></p>"
            }
          },
          "review_rPi8Fz": {
            "type": "review",
            "disabled": true,
            "settings": {
              "product": "",
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/sT_KtHZ1A_mid.jpg",
              "heading": "<p>T-Bar Bow</p>",
              "text": "<p>In love with this leopard shoes 😍<br/>they are super cute!</p>",
              "label": "<p>Edyta K.</p><p><em>Verified Customer</em></p>"
            }
          },
          "review_qGKXhg": {
            "type": "review",
            "disabled": true,
            "settings": {
              "product": "",
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/kH9i2FBF6_mid.jpg",
              "heading": "<p>Flower T-Bar Scallop</p>",
              "text": "<p>So beautiful and unique. The soft yellow color is even better in person, and they’re lightweight, comfortable, and easy to wear. Such a special little shoe 💛</p>",
              "label": "<p>Alina A.</p><p><em>Verified Customer</em></p>"
            }
          },
          "review_NjhYRJ": {
            "type": "review",
            "disabled": true,
            "settings": {
              "product": "",
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/41K2J3nV2_mid.jpg",
              "heading": "<p>Scallop Mary Jane</p>",
              "text": "<p>Absolutely stunning shoes! So well made and the perfect fit. We love ours!</p>",
              "label": "<p>Anouska T.</p><p><em>Verified Customer</em></p>"
            }
          },
          "review_Vtdjhm": {
            "type": "review",
            "disabled": true,
            "settings": {
              "product": "",
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/4YV9TaKnl8_mid.jpg",
              "heading": "<p>Everyday Shoe Velcro</p>",
              "text": "<p>Perfect shoes for a new walker! The velcro makes leaving the house quick and easy. Cognac leather is incredibly soft and comfortable, and the front protection is great for all the kicking. He really enjoys wearing them. 😊</p>",
              "label": "<p>Elena C.</p><p><em>Verified Customer</em></p>"
            }
          },
          "review_JD4eY4": {
            "type": "review",
            "disabled": true,
            "settings": {
              "product": "",
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/NUrYDL5oh_mid.jpg",
              "heading": "<p>T-Bar Scallop</p>",
              "text": "<p>These are the sweetest little red boots! The color is so rich and vibrant and the quality is fantastic as always. My daughter just loves them.</p>",
              "label": "<p>Elisabeth S.</p><p><em>Verified Customer</em></p>"
            }
          },
          "review_Y7NUmy": {
            "type": "review",
            "disabled": true,
            "settings": {
              "product": "",
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/KeXntpiM-S_mid.jpg",
              "heading": "<p>Low Sneaker</p>",
              "text": "<p>The shoes fit my son perfectly. They have a good fit and a lovely design as always. He picks them first when we are heading out the door. 🤍<br/></p>",
              "label": "<p>Janni L.</p><p><em>Verified Customer</em></p>"
            }
          },
          "review_6M4jeP": {
            "type": "review",
            "disabled": true,
            "settings": {
              "product": "",
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/ChubbyCruiserVelcroDoveSuede_lujassunshine_1_600x_51f117ec-97e3-45ee-aab2-b9634f76aee2.webp",
              "heading": "<p>Chubby Cruiser Velcro</p>",
              "text": "<p>Such a pretty shade! I love those shoes, they are easy and fast to wear, perfect for a spring walk!</p>",
              "label": "<p>Julia</p><p><em>Verified Customer</em></p>"
            }
          },
          "review_Qf8wxL": {
            "type": "review",
            "disabled": true,
            "settings": {
              "product": "",
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/Hwo_qFEv3_mid.jpg",
              "heading": "<p>Low T-Bar Flower</p>",
              "text": "<p>So pretty for a beautiful spring look! We love them! The quality is amazing like always with Petit Nord.</p>",
              "label": "<p>Julia</p><p><em>Verified Customer</em></p>"
            }
          },
          "review_6xV7VV": {
            "type": "review",
            "disabled": true,
            "settings": {
              "product": "",
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/fm_ho1NxNK_mid.jpg",
              "heading": "<p>Baby Scallop T-bar</p>",
              "text": "<p>Most adorable little shoes I have ever seen. They are gorgeous! 🤎</p>",
              "label": "<p>Edyta K.</p><p><em>Verified Customer</em></p>"
            }
          },
          "review_XMwGpU": {
            "type": "review",
            "disabled": true,
            "settings": {
              "product": "",
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/htQpkwiK7.jpg",
              "heading": "<p>Chubby Cruiser Velcro</p>",
              "text": "<p>Beautifully crafted shoes! Solid and supportive outside and luxuriously soft inside. Velcro straps are easy for little hands to take on and off. The suede leather is of a lovely quality and the colour is vibrant and stylish!</p>",
              "label": "<p>Sarah K.</p><p><em>Verified Customer</em></p>"
            }
          },
          "review_mm98Vk": {
            "type": "review",
            "disabled": true,
            "settings": {
              "product": "",
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/everyday_shoe_lace_-_ballerina_alleyalina.jpg",
              "heading": "<p>Everyday Shoe Lace</p>",
              "text": "<p>My little one absolutely adores them, and it’s easy to see why. They’re designed for busy mornings—so easy to put on and take off—and the flexibility ensures every step is comfortable and natural. The leather quality is simply amazing, offering durability and a luxurious feel. A perfect blend of style, practicality, and comfort!</p>",
              "label": "<p>Alyonka A.</p><p><em>Verified Customer</em></p>"
            }
          },
          "review_WCTCmw": {
            "type": "review",
            "disabled": true,
            "settings": {
              "product": "",
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/JQ3QxvbbaB_mid.jpg",
              "heading": "<p>Classic Boot</p>",
              "text": "<p>Most comfy and stylish shoes for toddler. I do absolutely love them and my baby girl to! 🤎</p>",
              "label": "<p>Edyta K.</p><p><em>Verified Customer</em></p>"
            }
          },
          "review_akR3fY": {
            "type": "review",
            "disabled": true,
            "settings": {
              "product": "",
